  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/abolitionism> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The interracial movement to end slavery in the United States, which grew from Quaker and revolutionary-era antislavery societies and gradual-emancipation laws into the radical demand for immediate emancipation in the 1830s, and which helped bring about the Thirteenth Amendment of 1865." .
