  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/reconstruction-era/timeline/6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The first Reconstruction Act becomes law over Johnson's veto, placing the former Confederate states except Tennessee under five military districts." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/reconstruction-era/timeline/6> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1867-03-02"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
