  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/reconstruction-era/timeline/9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "A Baltimore parade celebrates the Fifteenth Amendment, which bars racial discrimination in voting; the same year Congress passes the first Enforcement Act against intimidation at the polls." .
