  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/source/reconstruction-era/s7> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Reconstruction in the West (Forum: The Future of Reconstruction Studies)" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/source/reconstruction-era/s7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#Source> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/source/reconstruction-era/s7> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#sourceType> "academic" .
