  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/thirteenth-amendment/timeline/6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Lincoln approves the joint resolution sending the amendment to the states." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/thirteenth-amendment/timeline/6> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1865-02-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
