  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/montgomery-bus-boycott> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/fred-gray> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/montgomery-bus-boycott> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/jo-ann-robinson> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/montgomery-bus-boycott> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/montgomery-improvement-association> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/montgomery-bus-boycott> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/racial-segregation-in-the-united-states> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/montgomery-bus-boycott> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/rosa-parks> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/montgomery-bus-boycott> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/womens-political-council> .
