  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/battle-of-the-capes> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/marquis-de-lafayette> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/battle-of-the-capes> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/samuel-hood> .
