  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/jamestown/timeline/9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Governor George Yeardley convenes the first representative legislative assembly in English America." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/jamestown/timeline/9> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1619-07-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
