  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/jamestown> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "James Towne" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/jamestown> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Jamestown" .
