  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/jamestown> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The English fort and town founded in May 1607 on the James River in Tsenacomoco, the Powhatan paramount chiefdom of coastal Virginia; the first permanent English settlement in North America and capital of the colony of Virginia until 1699, where representative assembly, tobacco plantation agriculture and the forced labor of Africans took root in English America." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/jamestown> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/scheme/colonial-and-revolutionary> .
