  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/starving-time> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Starving Time" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/starving-time> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Winter of 1609–1610 at Jamestown" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/starving-time> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/jamestown> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/starving-time> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The famine at Jamestown, Virginia, in the winter of 1609–1610, when drought, a Powhatan siege, lost supplies and disease killed most of the English colonists, drove some to survival cannibalism, and nearly ended the colony before relief ships arrived in June 1610." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/starving-time> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/scheme/colonial-and-revolutionary> .
