  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/affordable-care-act> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/health-care-in-the-united-states> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/affordable-care-act> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The federal health care law signed by President Barack Obama on March 23, 2010, and amended a week later by the Health Care and Education Reconciliation Act, which expanded coverage through subsidized private insurance exchanges, a broader Medicaid program, an individual coverage requirement and new rules for insurers, and which survived three major Supreme Court challenges." .
