  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/deepwater-horizon-oil-spill/timeline/9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "BP closes the valves on a new containment cap and the oil stops flowing." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/deepwater-horizon-oil-spill/timeline/9> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "2010-07-15"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
