  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/winged-figures-of-the-republic> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/bureau-of-reclamation> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/winged-figures-of-the-republic> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/franklin-d-roosevelt> .
