  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/electoral-college> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The system set out in Article II of the Constitution and revised by the Twelfth Amendment under which the president and vice president are chosen by 538 electors appointed by the states and the District of Columbia, with a majority of 270 electoral votes needed to win." .
