  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/reynolds-v-sims> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The 1964 U.S. Supreme Court decision, written by Chief Justice Earl Warren, holding that the Equal Protection Clause requires the seats in both houses of a state legislature to be apportioned by population, applying the principle of one person, one vote to state lawmaking bodies." .
