  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/detroit-race-riot-of-1943> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/coleman-young> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/detroit-race-riot-of-1943> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/detroit-uprising-of-1967> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/detroit-race-riot-of-1943> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/detroit> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/detroit-race-riot-of-1943> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/franklin-d-roosevelt> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/detroit-race-riot-of-1943> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/labor-movement> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/detroit-race-riot-of-1943> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/naacp> .
