  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/detroit-race-riot-of-1943> <http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/source/detroit-race-riot-of-1943/s4> .
