  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/dust-bowl/timeline/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "By late January winds are lifting loose soil into dust storms." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/dust-bowl/timeline/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1932-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYearMonth> .
