  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/dust-bowl/timeline/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The Soil Erosion Service is set up in the Interior Department with Hugh Hammond Bennett as chief." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/dust-bowl/timeline/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1933-09"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYearMonth> .
