  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/dust-bowl/timeline/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "A great dust storm carries Plains soil over Washington, D.C., and out over the Atlantic." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/dust-bowl/timeline/5> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1934-05-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
