  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/dust-bowl/timeline/6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "A second March dust cloud darkens Washington as Congress holds hearings on soil conservation." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/dust-bowl/timeline/6> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1935-03-21"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
