  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/dust-bowl/timeline/7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Black Sunday: a dust front sweeps from central Nebraska toward the Mexican border; a reporter's account names the Dust Bowl." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/dust-bowl/timeline/7> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1935-04-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
