  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/dust-bowl/timeline/8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Roosevelt signs the Soil Conservation Act, creating the permanent Soil Conservation Service in the Agriculture Department." .
