  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/louisiana-purchase/timeline/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Spain's King Charles IV signs the decree transferring Louisiana to France, and the Spanish official at New Orleans revokes Americans' right of deposit." .
