  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/louisiana-purchase/timeline/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Jefferson sends James Monroe as minister extraordinary to join Robert Livingston in Paris, authorized to pay up to $10 million for New Orleans and the Floridas." .
