  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/war-of-1812/timeline/8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Oliver Hazard Perry's squadron wins the Battle of Lake Erie." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/war-of-1812/timeline/8> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1813-09-10"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/war-of-1812/timeline/9> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#TimelineEntry> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/war-of-1812/timeline/9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "William Henry Harrison's army wins the Battle of the Thames in Upper Canada; Tecumseh is killed." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/war-of-1812/timeline/9> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1813-10-05"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
