  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/war-of-1812> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The war the United States fought against Great Britain, its Canadian colonies and allied Native nations from June 1812 to February 1815, over British impressment of American sailors, restrictions on neutral trade and conflict on the northwestern frontier; the Treaty of Ghent ended it without changing the boundaries, but it shattered the Native confederacies that had allied with Britain." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/war-of-1812> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/scheme/early-republic-and-expansion> .
