  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/stock-market-crash-of-1929/timeline/9> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1929-10-30"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
