  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/source/triangle-shirtwaist-factory-fire/s5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#Source> .
