  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/nato/timeline/6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "President Harry S. Truman ratifies the treaty." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/nato/timeline/6> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1949-07-25"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
