  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/nato> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The military alliance created by the North Atlantic Treaty, signed in Washington on April 4, 1949, by the United States, Canada and ten Western European states; it was the first peacetime military alliance the United States joined outside the Western Hemisphere, and it grew from 12 to 32 members by 2024." .
