  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/panama-canal/timeline/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The Hay-Pauncefote Treaty supersedes Clayton-Bulwer, letting the United States build and run its own canal." .
