  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/panama-canal> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A lock canal across the Isthmus of Panama linking the Atlantic and Pacific Oceans, built by the United States from 1904 and opened on August 15, 1914, largely by West Indian laborers under a segregated pay system; the U.S. controlled it and the surrounding Canal Zone until transferring the canal to Panama on December 31, 1999." .
