  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/source/third-locks-project/s8> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "70 Years of Schemes to Improve and Enlarge the Panama Canal (J. David Rogers, World Environmental and Water Resources Congress 2012, ASCE)" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/source/third-locks-project/s8> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#Source> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/source/third-locks-project/s8> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#sourceType> "academic" .
