  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/chesapeake-bay/timeline/6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "A French fleet under de Grasse fights a British fleet at the Battle of the Capes, leaving France in control of the bay." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/chesapeake-bay/timeline/6> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1781-09-05"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
