  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/yellowstone-national-park/timeline/9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The U.S. Army takes charge of the park after Congress declines to fund its civilian administration." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/yellowstone-national-park/timeline/9> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1886-08-20"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
