  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/chinese-exclusion-act> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/burlingame-treaty> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/chinese-exclusion-act> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/chinese-americans> .
