  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/gilded-age/timeline/9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Federal troops break the Pullman sympathy strike led by the American Railway Union, and Eugene Debs is jailed." .
