  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/cherokee-nation-v-georgia> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "5 Pet. 1" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/cherokee-nation-v-georgia> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Cherokee Nation v Georgia" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/cherokee-nation-v-georgia> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "The Cherokee Nation v. the State of Georgia" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/cherokee-nation-v-georgia> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/federal-indian-law> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/cherokee-nation-v-georgia> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/marshall-trilogy> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/cherokee-nation-v-georgia> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The 1831 U.S. Supreme Court case in which the Cherokee Nation asked the Court to stop Georgia from enforcing its laws on Cherokee land; the Court dismissed the suit for lack of jurisdiction, holding that the Nation was not a foreign state under Article III but one of the \"domestic dependent nations\" whose relation to the United States resembled that of a ward to a guardian." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/cherokee-nation-v-georgia> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/scheme/native-nations> .
