  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/dawes-act/timeline/9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Funding ends for the Interior Department's Land Buy-Back Program, which restored nearly 3 million fractionated acres to tribal trust ownership." .
