  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/source/tribal-sovereignty/s7> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> "2026-11-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/source/tribal-sovereignty/s7> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/publisher> "National Congress of American Indians, via Native Nations Institute, University of Arizona" .
