  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/john-marshall/timeline/13> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Delivers the Court's opinion in Marbury v. Madison, establishing judicial review of acts of Congress." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/john-marshall/timeline/13> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1803"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
