  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/john-marshall/timeline/14> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Writes for the Court in McCulloch v. Maryland and the Dartmouth College case." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/john-marshall/timeline/14> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1819"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
