  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/john-marshall/timeline/15> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Grounds federal land title in the doctrine of discovery in Johnson v. M'Intosh." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/john-marshall/timeline/15> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1823"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
