  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/john-marshall/timeline/16> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Reads Congress's commerce power broadly in Gibbons v. Ogden." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/john-marshall/timeline/16> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1824"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
