  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/john-marshall/timeline/17> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Sits in the Virginia Constitutional Convention of 1829–30." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/john-marshall/timeline/17> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1829"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
