  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/john-marshall/timeline/18> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Holds in Worcester v. Georgia that Georgia's laws have no force in the Cherokee Nation." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/john-marshall/timeline/18> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1832"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
