  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/john-marshall/timeline/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Born near Germantown in Fauquier County, Virginia, one of fourteen children of Thomas and Mary Randolph Marshall." .
