  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/john-marshall/timeline/6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Marries Mary \"Polly\" Ambler and settles in Richmond; an enslaved man, Robin Spurlock, is given to the couple as a wedding present." .
