  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/17> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The first volume of the History of Woman Suffrage, by Stanton, Anthony and Matilda Joslyn Gage, is published." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/17> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1881"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
