  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/18> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The rival suffrage associations merge as the National American Woman Suffrage Association." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/18> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1890"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
