  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/19> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Becomes president of NAWSA, serving until Carrie Chapman Catt succeeds her in 1900." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/19> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1892"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#TimelineEntry> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Born in Adams, Massachusetts, to Daniel and Lucy Anthony." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1820-02-15"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
