  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/20> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Attends her last NAWSA convention, in Baltimore, and gives her final public remarks." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/20> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1906-02"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYearMonth> .
