  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/21> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Dies at her home in Rochester; she is buried in Mount Hope Cemetery." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/21> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1906-03-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
