  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The Anthony family moves to a farm near Rochester, New York, where antislavery Quakers gather on Sundays." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1845"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#TimelineEntry> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Teaching in Canajoharie, New York, she learns that male teachers earn $10 a month and women $2.50." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1848"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
