  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Amelia Bloomer introduces her to Elizabeth Cady Stanton in Seneca Falls, New York." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1851"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
