  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Works as an agent of the American Anti-Slavery Society." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/5> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1856"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#TimelineEntry> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Helps found the Women's Loyal National League to petition for emancipation." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/6> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1863"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
