  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "With Stanton, forms the National Woman Suffrage Association after the movement splits over the Fifteenth Amendment." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/8> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1869"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
