  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Registers to vote in Rochester's Eighth Ward with her three sisters and other women, citing the Fourteenth Amendment." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/susan-b-anthony/timeline/9> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1872-11-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
