  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/andrew-jackson/timeline/16> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The Senate votes to expunge the censure; his second term ends on March 4." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/andrew-jackson/timeline/16> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1837-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYearMonth> .
