  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/andrew-jackson/timeline/17> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Dies at the Hermitage, his cotton plantation near Nashville." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/andrew-jackson/timeline/17> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1845-06-08"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
