  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/andrew-jackson/timeline/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Born in the Waxhaw settlement on the Carolina frontier, a few months after his father's death." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/andrew-jackson/timeline/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1767-03-15"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
