  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/andrew-jackson/timeline/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Captured by the British with his brother Robert during the Revolutionary War; both contract smallpox, and Robert dies." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/andrew-jackson/timeline/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1781"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
