  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/andrew-jackson/timeline/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Moves to Nashville as district attorney for the Mero District." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/andrew-jackson/timeline/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1788"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/andrew-jackson/timeline/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#TimelineEntry> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/andrew-jackson/timeline/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Elected Tennessee's first member of the U.S. House of Representatives; the next year the legislature sends him to the Senate." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/andrew-jackson/timeline/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1796"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
