  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/andrew-jackson/timeline/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Elected major general of the Tennessee militia." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/andrew-jackson/timeline/5> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1802"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/andrew-jackson/timeline/6> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#TimelineEntry> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/andrew-jackson/timeline/6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Defeats the Red Stick Creeks at Horseshoe Bend; the Treaty of Fort Jackson in August takes most Creek land in Alabama and southern Georgia." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/andrew-jackson/timeline/6> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1814-03"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYearMonth> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/andrew-jackson/timeline/7> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#TimelineEntry> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/andrew-jackson/timeline/7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Defeats the British at New Orleans, weeks after the Treaty of Ghent was signed." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/andrew-jackson/timeline/7> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1815-01-08"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
