  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/andrew-jackson/timeline/8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Invades Spanish Florida during the First Seminole War; Spain cedes Florida in an 1819 treaty." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/andrew-jackson/timeline/8> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1818"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
