  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/andrew-jackson/timeline/9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Leads the popular and electoral vote in a four-way race but loses in the House of Representatives to John Quincy Adams." .
