  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/benjamin-franklin> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Dr. Franklin" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/benjamin-franklin> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Franklin" .
