  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/franklin-d-roosevelt/timeline/16> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Elected to a fourth term, defeating Thomas E. Dewey." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/franklin-d-roosevelt/timeline/16> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1944-11-07"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
