  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/franklin-d-roosevelt> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The 32nd president of the United States (1933–1945), a New York Democrat who led the country through the Great Depression with the New Deal and through most of World War II, won four presidential elections, and governed from a wheelchair after polio paralyzed his legs in 1921." .
