  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/chicago/timeline/19> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The City Council votes to rename Lake Shore Drive in honor of DuSable." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/chicago/timeline/19> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "2021-06"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYearMonth> .
