  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/chicago/timeline/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "French explorer Louis Jolliet notes the low divide at Chicago between the Great Lakes and Mississippi drainage systems." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/chicago/timeline/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1673"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
