  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/chicago/timeline/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Jean Baptiste Point DuSable, the first non-Native person to set up a permanent post at Chicago, sells his property there." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/chicago/timeline/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1800-05"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYearMonth> .
