  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/chicago/timeline/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The U.S. Army erects Fort Dearborn near the mouth of the Chicago River." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/chicago/timeline/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1803"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/chicago/timeline/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#TimelineEntry> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/chicago/timeline/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Chicago receives its first town charter; the Treaty of Chicago forces the Potawatomi to cede their last Illinois lands and move west of the Mississippi." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/chicago/timeline/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1833"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
