  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/chicago/timeline/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Illinois grants Chicago its first city charter, with six wards and a mayor." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/chicago/timeline/5> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1837"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
