  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/chicago/timeline/6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The Illinois & Michigan Canal is completed, the first railroad opens, the telegraph arrives and the Board of Trade is founded." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/chicago/timeline/6> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1848"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
