  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/chicago/timeline/8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The Great Fire begins in the O'Leary barn on DeKoven Street and burns about 3.5 square miles of the city." .
