  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/new-orleans> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Louisiana's largest city, founded by the French in 1718 on a natural levee near the mouth of the Mississippi River on land Choctaw speakers call Bulbancha; a colonial capital, the nation's largest antebellum slave market, the birthplace of jazz, and a low-lying port whose levees failed during Hurricane Katrina in 2005." .
