  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/the-west> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "West Region" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/the-west> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Western United States" .
