  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/fourteenth-amendment/timeline/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Congress passes the Civil Rights Act of 1866." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/fourteenth-amendment/timeline/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1866-04"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYearMonth> .
