  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/apollo-11/timeline/12> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Columbia goes on permanent display in the new National Air and Space Museum." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/apollo-11/timeline/12> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1976"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
