  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/lunar-laser-ranging-experiment/timeline/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "NASA reaches agreement with Lick Observatory, leaving only months to prepare the telescope and laser." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/lunar-laser-ranging-experiment/timeline/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1969-02"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYearMonth> .
