  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/lunar-laser-ranging-experiment/timeline/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Apollo 11 astronauts set the reflector array on the lunar surface about 20 feet from the lunar module." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/lunar-laser-ranging-experiment/timeline/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1969-07-21"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/lunar-laser-ranging-experiment/timeline/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#TimelineEntry> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/lunar-laser-ranging-experiment/timeline/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Lick Observatory's 120-inch telescope detects the first laser returns from the array." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/lunar-laser-ranging-experiment/timeline/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1969-08-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
