  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/lunar-laser-ranging-experiment/timeline/5> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "A faster-firing laser at Lick records 98 range measurements in one night." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/lunar-laser-ranging-experiment/timeline/5> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1969-08-03"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
