  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/lunar-laser-ranging-experiment/timeline/6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "McDonald Observatory in Texas makes its first acquisition measurements of the array." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/lunar-laser-ranging-experiment/timeline/6> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1969-08-20"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
