  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/lunar-laser-ranging-experiment/timeline/7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The Soviet Luna 17 mission lands the Lunokhod 1 rover carrying a reflector array." .
