  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/morrill-land-grant-college-act> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Land-Grant College Act of 1862" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/morrill-land-grant-college-act> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "Morrill Act of 1862" .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/morrill-land-grant-college-act> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/higher-education-in-the-united-states> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/morrill-land-grant-college-act> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The federal law signed by President Abraham Lincoln on July 2, 1862, that gave each loyal state 30,000 acres of federal land or land scrip per member of Congress to endow colleges teaching agriculture and the mechanic arts, founding the land-grant university system — largely with land taken from Native nations." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/morrill-land-grant-college-act> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/scheme/science-and-innovation> .
