  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/chinese-americans/timeline/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "At Promontory Summit, Utah Territory, eight Chinese workers move the final rail into place for the transcontinental railroad." .
