  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/chinese-americans/timeline/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The Chinese Exclusion Act suspends the immigration of Chinese laborers and bars Chinese immigrants from naturalization." .
