  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/chinese-americans/timeline/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "White miners kill 28 Chinese miners and burn the Chinatown of Rock Springs, Wyoming Territory." .
