  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/pennsylvania/timeline/9> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The Assembly passes the Gradual Abolition Act, the first emancipation statute in the United States." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/pennsylvania/timeline/9> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1780-03-01"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
