  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/wyoming/timeline/18> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Nellie Tayloe Ross takes office as the first elected woman governor in the United States." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/wyoming/timeline/18> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1925-01-05"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
