  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/wyoming/timeline/6> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The second Fort Bridger treaty sets aside about 3.2 million acres in the Wind River Valley for the Eastern Shoshone." .
