  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/wyoming/timeline/7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Congress creates Wyoming Territory; the 1868 Fort Laramie treaty negotiated with Red Cloud closes the Bozeman Trail the same year." .
