  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/e-pluribus-unum/timeline/8> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "An act of Congress declares 'In God we trust' the national motto; E pluribus unum stays on the seal and coins." .
