  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/national-symbols-of-the-united-states/timeline/14> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The 50-star flag becomes official after Hawaii's admission as a state." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/national-symbols-of-the-united-states/timeline/14> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1960-07-04"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
