  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/national-symbols-of-the-united-states/timeline/15> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Congress honors Samuel Wilson of Troy, New York, as the progenitor of Uncle Sam." .
