  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/national-symbols-of-the-united-states/timeline/17> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1987-12-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
