  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/national-symbols-of-the-united-states/timeline/18> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1989-06-21"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
