  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/national-symbols-of-the-united-states/timeline/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The Second Continental Congress appoints Benjamin Franklin, John Adams and Thomas Jefferson to design a seal for the United States." .
