  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/national-symbols-of-the-united-states/timeline/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The Continental Congress adopts a flag of 13 red and white stripes and 13 white stars on a blue field." .
