  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/national-symbols-of-the-united-states/timeline/4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#TimelineEntry> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/national-symbols-of-the-united-states/timeline/4> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The Confederation Congress approves the Great Seal, with a bald eagle holding arrows and an olive branch." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/national-symbols-of-the-united-states/timeline/4> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1782-06-20"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
