  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/national-symbols-of-the-united-states/timeline/7> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "President Woodrow Wilson proclaims a national Flag Day on June 14." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/national-symbols-of-the-united-states/timeline/7> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/ontology#date> "1916"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#gYear> .
