  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/national-symbols-of-the-united-states> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/american-national-identity> .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/national-symbols-of-the-united-states> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The emblems, mottoes, songs, plants, animals and figures that represent the United States: some, like the flag, the Great Seal, the national anthem and the national motto, were designated by Congress, while others, like Uncle Sam, became symbols through popular use." .
  <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/national-symbols-of-the-united-states> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://github.com/john1hsu/usa-graph/id/scheme/symbols-and-national-identity> .
